a46f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ba4b45e-2f02-4c78-a653-d19b2e817a46</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>58</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4:5ba4b45e-2f02-4c78-a653-d19b2e817a46:f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing of Source Data Store D4 นักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D4 นักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to incorrect data delivered to 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the source data store.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>รายชื่อ (ไม่นับผู้ถอน)</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThre