process. Similarly, Tampering with a data flow involves changing bits on the wire or between two running processes.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>SQL injection is an attack in which malicious code is inserted into strings that are later passed to an instance of SQL Server for parsing and execution. Any procedure that constructs SQL statements should be reviewed for injection vulnerabilities because SQL Server will execute all syntactically valid queries that it receives. Even parameterized data can be manipulated by a skilled and determined attacker.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเกณฑ์ของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>T7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D284ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a3f0f1660-2a3c-43b5-b8ad-a324cfe830da46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>0df06edf-e481-4ed2-b4c5-4c53b6b2b1e4</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>3f0f1660-2a3c-43b5-b8ad-a324cfe830da</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>172</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a:3f0f1660-2a3c-43b5-b8ad-a324cfe830da:46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Excessive Resource Consumption for 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา or D2 รายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Does 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา or D2 รายวิชา take explicit steps to control resource consumption? Resource consumption attacks can be hard to deal with, and there are times that it makes sense to let the OS do the job. Be careful that your resource requests don't deadlock, and that they do timeout.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเกณฑ์ของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S3a08c98fb-4a1c-41ba-add1-31871753979e5bc08263-b902-4105-804b-52e794cf2462273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>e6a37892-c207-456f-9bf9-99b7198d889d</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5bc08263-b902-4105-804b-52e794cf2462</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>173</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>a08c98fb-4a1c-41ba-add1-31871753979e:5bc08263-b902-4105-804b-52e794cf2462:273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the ผู้ดูแลระบบ External Entity</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ผู้ดูแลระบบ may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to unauthorized access to ระบบ CMAS ติดตามและประเมินผลลัพธ์การเรียนรู้ ระดับรายวิชา (CLO). Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the external entity.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเข้าสู่ระบบ การอนุมัติและปิดบัญชี การมอบหมายผู้สอน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>a08c98fb-4a1c-41ba-add1-31871753979e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S3</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E5a08c98fb-4a1c-41ba-add1-31871753979e5bc08263-b902-4105-804b-52e794cf2462273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>e6a37892-c207-456f-9bf9-99b7198d889d</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5bc08263-b902-4105-804b-52e794cf2462</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>174</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>a08c98fb-4a1c-41ba-add1-31871753979e:5bc08263-b902-4105-804b-52e794cf2462:273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Using Impersonation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ระบบ CMAS ติดตามและประเมินผลลัพธ์การเรียนรู้ ระดับรายวิชา (CLO) may be able to impersonate the context of ผู้ดูแลระบบ in order to gain additional privilege.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเข้าสู่ระบบ การอนุมัติและปิดบัญชี การมอบหมายผู้สอน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>a08c98fb-4a1c-41ba-add1-31871753979e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S38bb693a4-418a-47d8-8dbc-4f35b6b0ead1a590a097-61c1-46a8-b98e-3bae632442c0273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>e6a37892-c207-456f-9bf9-99b7198d889d</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>a590a097-61c1-46a8-b98e-3bae632442c0</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>175</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>8bb693a4-418a-47d8-8dbc-4f35b6b0ead1:a590a097-61c1-46a8-b98e-3bae632442c0:273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the Google บริการยืนยันตัวตน External Entity</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Google บริการยืนยันตัวตน may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to unauthorized access to ระบบ CMAS ติดตามและประเมินผลลัพธ์การเรียนรู้ ระดับรายวิชา (CLO). Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the external entity.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลยืนยันตัวตน (อีเมล ชื่อ)</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>8bb693a4-418a-47d8-8dbc-4f35b6b0ead1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S3</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E58bb693a4-418a-47d8-8dbc-4f35b6b0ead1a590a097-61c1-46a8-b98e-3bae632442c0273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>e6a37892-c207-456f-9bf9-99b7198d889d</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>a590a097-61c1-46a8-b98e-3bae632442c0</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>176</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>8bb693a4-418a-47d8-8dbc-4f35b6b0ead1:a590a097-61c1-46a8-b98e-3bae632442c0:273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Using Impersonation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ระบบ CMAS ติดตามและประเมินผลลัพธ์การเรียนรู้ ระดับรายวิชา (CLO) may be able to impersonate the context of Google บริการยืนยันตัวตน in order to gain additional privilege.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลยืนยันตัวตน (อีเมล ชื่อ)</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>8bb693a4-418a-47d8-8dbc-4f35b6b0ead1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S3c1706be3-f97f-4c81-a7a7-4951a78383021cb338c5-8eeb-4b84-b5e4-d779aaea4aa4273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>e6a37892-c207-456f-9bf9-99b7198d889d</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>1cb338c5-8eeb-4b84-b5e4-d779aaea4aa4</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>177</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>c1706be3-f97f-4c81-a7a7-4951a7838302:1cb338c5-8eeb-4b84-b5e4-d779aaea4aa4:273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the ผู้สอน External Entity</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ผู้สอน may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to unauthorized access to ระบบ CMAS ติดตามและประเมินผลลัพธ์การเรียนรู้ ระดับรายวิชา (CLO). Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the external entity.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเข้าสู่ระบบ ข้อมูลรายวิชาและการตั้งค่า CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์วัดผล รายชื่อนักศึกษา คะแนน (กรอกเองหรือไฟล์ Excel) ช่วงเกรดและการปรับเกรด</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>c1706be3-f97f-4c81-a7a7-4951a7838302</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S3</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E5c1706be3-f97f-4c81-a7a7-4951a78383021cb338c5-8eeb-4b84-b5e4-d779aaea4aa4273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>e6a37892-c207-456f-9bf9-99b7198d889d</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>1cb338c5-8eeb-4b84-b5e4-d779aaea4aa4</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>178</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>c1706be3-f97f-4c81-a7a7-4951a7838302:1cb338c5-8eeb-4b84-b5e4-d779aaea4aa4:273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Using Impersonation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ระบบ CMAS ติดตามและประเมินผลลัพธ์การเรียนรู้ ระดับรายวิชา (CLO) may be able to impersonate the context of ผู้สอน in order to gain additional privilege.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเข้าสู่ระบบ ข้อมูลรายวิชาและการตั้งค่า CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์วัดผล รายชื่อนักศึกษา คะแนน (กรอกเองหรือไฟล์ Excel) ช่วงเกรดและการปรับเกรด</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>c1706be3-f97f-4c81-a7a7-4951a7838302</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>273d5979-11de-42d5-902a-892a6c7412a0</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E5c6386458-3bb0-42ae-a01e-5cc88646a797d2627ee7-9725-4fb3-9a0f-e872927e859ef5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>d2627ee7-9725-4fb3-9a0f-e872927e859e</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>180</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>c6386458-3bb0-42ae-a01e-5cc88646a797:d2627ee7-9725-4fb3-9a0f-e872927e859e:f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Using Impersonation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด may be able to impersonate the context of ผู้สอน in order to gain additional privilege.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกรด · สถิติ · ไฟล์ผลการเรียน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>c6386458-3bb0-42ae-a01e-5cc88646a797</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D2f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284678b244d-980b-46cc-a055-364da6e89e14d27e3d6e-466b-41e6-b9f7-1a81d7fae93b</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>678b244d-980b-46cc-a055-364da6e89e14</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>183</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284:678b244d-980b-46cc-a055-364da6e89e14:d27e3d6e-466b-41e6-b9f7-1a81d7fae93b</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Excessive Resource Consumption for 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด or D6 เกรด</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Does 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด or D6 เกรด take explicit steps to control resource consumption? Resource consumption attacks can be hard to deal with, and there are times that it makes sense to let the OS do the job. Be careful that your resource requests don't deadlock, and that they do timeout.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด เกรดที่ตรึง</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>d27e3d6e-466b-41e6-b9f7-1a81d7fae93b</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S7d27e3d6e-466b-41e6-b9f7-1a81d7fae93bbbbfdb12-5d4e-45fb-8209-2c7eccfca08ef5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>bbbfdb12-5d4e-45fb-8209-2c7eccfca08e</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>184</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>d27e3d6e-466b-41e6-b9f7-1a81d7fae93b:bbbfdb12-5d4e-45fb-8209-2c7eccfca08e:f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing of Source Data Store D6 เกรด</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D6 เกรด may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to incorrect data delivered to 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the source data store.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด เกรดที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>d27e3d6e-466b-41e6-b9f7-1a81d7fae93b</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>I23d27e3d6e-466b-41e6-b9f7-1a81d7fae93bbbbfdb12-5d4e-45fb-8209-2c7eccfca08ef5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>bbbfdb12-5d4e-45fb-8209-2c7eccfca08e</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>185</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>d27e3d6e-466b-41e6-b9f7-1a81d7fae93b:bbbfdb12-5d4e-45fb-8209-2c7eccfca08e:f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Weak Access Control for a Resource</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Information Disclosure</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Information disclosure happens when the information can be read by an unauthorized party.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Improper data protection of D6 เกรด can allow an attacker to read information not intended for disclosure. Review authorization settings.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด เกรดที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>d27e3d6e-466b-41e6-b9f7-1a81d7fae93b</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>I23</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S7.174c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc223dcccb1-445d-4a7f-a998-f5b97d6c78c50d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>23dcccb1-445d-4a7f-a998-f5b97d6c78c5</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>193</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2:23dcccb1-445d-4a7f-a998-f5b97d6c78c5:0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing of Destination Data Store D4 นักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D4 นักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to data being written to the attacker's target instead of D4 นักศึกษา. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination data store.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S7.1</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>T774c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc223dcccb1-445d-4a7f-a998-f5b97d6c78c50d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>23dcccb1-445d-4a7f-a998-f5b97d6c78c5</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>194</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2:23dcccb1-445d-4a7f-a998-f5b97d6c78c5:0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential SQL Injection Vulnerability for D4 นักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering is the act of altering the bits. Tampering with a process involves changing bits in the running process. Similarly, Tampering with a data flow involves changing bits on the wire or between two running processes.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>SQL injection is an attack in which malicious code is inserted into strings that are later passed to an instance of SQL Server for parsing and execution. Any procedure that constructs SQL statements should be reviewed for injection vulnerabilities because SQL Server will execute all syntactically valid queries that it receives. Even parameterized data can be manipulated by a skilled and determined attacker.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>T7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D274c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc223dcccb1-445d-4a7f-a998-f5b97d6c78c50d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>23dcccb1-445d-4a7f-a998-f5b97d6c78c5</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>195</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2:23dcccb1-445d-4a7f-a998-f5b97d6c78c5:0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Excessive Resource Consumption for 4.0 บันทึกและนำเข้าคะแนน or D4 นักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Does 4.1 แสดงตารางคะแนน และออกแบบฟอร์ม Excel or D4 นักศึกษา take explicit steps to control resource consumption? Resource consumption attacks can be hard to deal with, and there are times that it makes sense to let the OS do the job. Be careful that your resource requests don't deadlock, and that they do timeout.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S70d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17c3077b4e-cb9d-48be-be8d-30e76937374674c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c3077b4e-cb9d-48be-be8d-30e769373746</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>196</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17:c3077b4e-cb9d-48be-be8d-30e769373746:74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing of Source Data Store D4 นักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D4 นักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to incorrect data delivered to 4.1 แสดงตารางคะแนน และออกแบบฟอร์ม Excel. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the source data store.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คะแนนที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>I230d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17c3077b4e-cb9d-48be-be8d-30e76937374674c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c3077b4e-cb9d-48be-be8d-30e769373746</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>197</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17:c3077b4e-cb9d-48be-be8d-30e769373746:74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Weak Access Control for a Resource</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Information Disclosure</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Information disclosure happens when the information can be read by an unauthorized party.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Improper data protection of D4 นักศึกษา can allow an attacker to read information not intended for disclosure. Review authorization settings.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คะแนนที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>0d64a30e-10bc-40e3-99d4-da420c7b6c17</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>I23</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S7.174c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2ea510787-1ed3-4dc9-b7de-f3820b0a5ed372971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>ea510787-1ed3-4dc9-b7de-f3820b0a5ed3</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>198</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2:ea510787-1ed3-4dc9-b7de-f3820b0a5ed3:72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing of Destination Data Store D5 คะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D5 คะแนน may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to data being written to the attacker's target instead of D5 คะแนน. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination data store.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอรายชื่อ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S7.1</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D274c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2ea510787-1ed3-4dc9-b7de-f3820b0a5ed372971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.dataco