s increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D2 รายวิชา may be able to remotely execute code for 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E746a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c938f1d19-bad9-4c7f-804b-b278a830174a84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>0df06edf-e481-4ed2-b4c5-4c53b6b2b1e4</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>938f1d19-bad9-4c7f-804b-b278a830174a</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>378</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c:938f1d19-bad9-4c7f-804b-b278a830174a:84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา in order to change the flow of program execution within 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S288315e4e-bada-4889-8a5a-ee3cc1a47fb96ff7c5c6-721a-4f07-8b17-7d7bf3bddf3884ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>0df06edf-e481-4ed2-b4c5-4c53b6b2b1e4</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>6ff7c5c6-721a-4f07-8b17-7d7bf3bddf38</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>379</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>88315e4e-bada-4889-8a5a-ee3cc1a47fb9:6ff7c5c6-721a-4f07-8b17-7d7bf3bddf38:84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>CLO · กิจกรรม · น้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>88315e4e-bada-4889-8a5a-ee3cc1a47fb9</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R688315e4e-bada-4889-8a5a-ee3cc1a47fb96ff7c5c6-721a-4f07-8b17-7d7bf3bddf3884ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>0df06edf-e481-4ed2-b4c5-4c53b6b2b1e4</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>6ff7c5c6-721a-4f07-8b17-7d7bf3bddf38</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>380</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>88315e4e-bada-4889-8a5a-ee3cc1a47fb9:6ff7c5c6-721a-4f07-8b17-7d7bf3bddf38:84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>CLO · กิจกรรม · น้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>88315e4e-bada-4889-8a5a-ee3cc1a47fb9</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D388315e4e-bada-4889-8a5a-ee3cc1a47fb96ff7c5c6-721a-4f07-8b17-7d7bf3bddf3884ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>0df06edf-e481-4ed2-b4