</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D584ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a3f0f1660-2a3c-43b5-b8ad-a324cfe830da46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>0df06edf-e481-4ed2-b4c5-4c53b6b2b1e4</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>3f0f1660-2a3c-43b5-b8ad-a324cfe830da</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>441</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a:3f0f1660-2a3c-43b5-b8ad-a324cfe830da:46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Store Inaccessible</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent prevents access to a data store on the other side of the trust boundary.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเกณฑ์ของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>84ac42c4-2f1f-45ec-a2c9-d1e8d6533c4a</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>46a3fc6e-cb1e-40ec-a7c5-c6afecc8b41c</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E64c9c078c-f005-4be1-85b6-9e3e69c85cae7c162bd1-5361-4f46-8994-3427349450fcfa2e0525-17fd-47e8-8a55-efdca2f2acb5</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>7c162bd1-5361-4f46-8994-3427349450fc</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>453</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>4c9c078c-f005-4be1-85b6-9e3e69c85cae:7c162bd1-5361-4f46-8994-3427349450fc:fa2e0525-17fd-47e8-8a55-efdca2f2acb5</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>1.0 เข้าสู่ระบบและดูแลบัญชี May be Subject to Elevation of Privilege Using Remote Code Execution</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D1 บัญชีผู้ใช้ may be able to remotely execute code for 1.0 เข้าสู่ระบบและดูแลบัญชี.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ข้อมูลบัญชี</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>4c9c078c-f005-4be1-85b6-9e3e69c85cae</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>fa2e0525-17fd-47e8-8a55-efdca2f2acb5</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E74c9c078c-f005-4be1-85b6-9e3e69c85cae7c162bd1-5361-4f46-8994-3427349450fcfa2e0525-17fd-47e8-8a55-efdca2f2acb5</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>7c162bd1-5361-4f46-8994-3427349450fc</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>454</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>4c9c078c-f005-4be1-85b6-9e3e69c85cae:7c162bd1-5361-4f46-8994-3427349450fc:fa2e0525-17fd-47e8-8a55-efdca2f2acb5</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 1.0 เข้าสู่ระบบและดูแลบัญชี</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 1.0 เข้าสู่ระบบและดูแลบัญชี in order to change the flow of program execution within 1.0 เข้าสู่ระบบและดูแลบัญชี to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ข้อมูลบัญชี</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>4c9c078c-f005-4be1-85b6-