o spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent prevents access to a data store on the other side of the trust boundary.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ข้อมูลนักศึกษา · สถานะถอน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>1b11bd38-67d1-4d31-9e54-bf5c662948b1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S2c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb45225b2a8-af09-4d0d-aaec-fc4b3a4a828b1b11bd38-67d1-4d31-9e54-bf5c662948b1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5225b2a8-af09-4d0d-aaec-fc4b3a4a828b</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>494</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4:5225b2a8-af09-4d0d-aaec-fc4b3a4a828b:1b11bd38-67d1-4d31-9e54-bf5c662948b1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 5.0 จัดการรายชื่อนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>5.0 จัดการรายชื่อนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by D4 นักศึกษา. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>รายชื่อที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>1b11bd38-67d1-4d31-9e54-bf5c662948b1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R6c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb45225b2a8-af09-4d0d-aaec-fc4b3a4a828b1b11bd38-67d1-4d31-9e54-bf5c662948b1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5225b2a8-af09-4d0d-aaec-fc4b3a4a828b</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>495</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4:5225b2a8-af09-4d0d-aaec-fc4b3a4a828b:1b11bd38-67d1-4d31-9e54-bf5c662948b1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 5.0 จัดการรายชื่อนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>5.0 จัดการรายชื่อนักศึกษา claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>รายชื่อที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>1b11bd38-67d1-4d31-9e54-bf5c662948b1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D3c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb45225b2a8-af09-4d0d-aaec-fc4b3a4a828b1b11bd38-67d1-4d31-9e54-bf5c662948b1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5225b2a8-af09-4d0d-aaec-fc4b3a4a828b</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>496</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4:5225b2a8-af09-4d0d-aaec-fc4b3a4a828b:1b11bd38-67d1-4d31-9e54-bf5c662948b1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:Modifie