"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>66e95bf0-5804-4911-81ca-90bbe52997a0</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>527</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4:66e95bf0-5804-4911-81ca-90bbe52997a0:0a5e9a2e-215d-4a9c-b2a1-ec2fc491ab28</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 4.0 บันทึกและนำเข้าคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 4.0 บันทึกและนำเข้าคะแนน in order to change the flow of program execution within 4.0 บันทึกและนำเข้าคะแนน to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คะแนนที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>c16770c8-07a4-424e-b80f-b45e5eb2beb4</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>0a5e9a2e-215d-4a9c-b2a1-ec2fc491ab28</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S2e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f893296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>93296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>528</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f8:93296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25:f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by D2 รายวิชา. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f8</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R6e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f893296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>93296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>529</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f8:93296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25:f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f8</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D3e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f893296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>93296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>530</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f8:93296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25:f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for 6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.0 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา ตัดเกรด crashes, halts, stops or runs slowly; in all cases violating an availability metric.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f8</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D3</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D4e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f893296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6bb13faf-99a2-46be-9b0d-a25075c9a323</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>93296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>531</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e1eaa825-f886-4a34-b952-5f149a6868f8:93296afb-cf0d-4008-a015-946047564b25:f5955920-e121-4620-becd-c3deca036284</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key