true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>4.1 แสดงตารางคะแนน และออกแบบฟอร์ม Excel May be Subject to Elevation of Privilege Using Remote Code Execution</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D5 คะแนน may be able to remotely execute code for 4.1 แสดงตารางคะแนน และออกแบบฟอร์ม Excel.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>รายชื่อนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E772971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c342277f5c01f1-55b7-47d3-b8ea-dcba2ceb53f174c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>7f5c01f1-55b7-47d3-b8ea-dcba2ceb53f1</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>792</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227:7f5c01f1-55b7-47d3-b8ea-dcba2ceb53f1:74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 4.1 แสดงตารางคะแนน และออกแบบฟอร์ม Excel</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 4.1 แสดงตารางคะแนน และออกแบบฟอร์ม Excel in order to change the flow of program execution within 4.1 แสดงตารางคะแนน และออกแบบฟอร์ม Excel to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>รายชื่อนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>74c38d87-e600-4de7-9224-3773aa1a4fc2</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S2152a9786-c3ef-4613-b437-300884f70771e32725cf-dbf7-469d-aab7-84f43102220cef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>e32725cf-dbf7-469d-aab7-84f43102220c</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>793</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>152a9786-c3ef-4613-b437-300884f70771:e32725cf-dbf7-469d-aab7-84f43102220c:ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คะแนนเต็ม · สถานะปิดรับ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>152a9786-c3ef-4613-b437-300884f70771</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R6152a9786-c3ef-4613-b437-300884f70771e32725cf-dbf7-469d-aab7-84f43102220cef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>e32725cf-dbf7-469d-aab7-84f43102220c</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>794</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>152a9786-c3ef-4613-b437-300884f70771:e32725cf-dbf7-469d-aab7-84f43102220c:ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คะแนนเต็ม · สถานะปิดรับ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>152a9786-c3ef-4613-b437-300884f70771</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D3152a9786-c3ef-4613-b437-300884f70771e32725cf-dbf7-469d-aab7-84f43102220cef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>e32725cf-dbf7-469d-aab7-84f43102220c</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>795</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>152a9786-c3ef-4613-b437-300884f70771:e32725cf-dbf7-469d-aab7-84f43102220c:ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for 4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน crashes, halts, stops or runs slowly; in all cases violating an availability metric.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คะแนนเต็ม · สถานะปิดรับ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>152a9786-c3ef-4613-b437-300884f70771</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a6