 datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent prevents access to a data store on the other side of the trust boundary.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอตรวจรหัสนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S272971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913def2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913d</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>825</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227:f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913d:ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by D5 คะแนน. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>รายชื่อและสถานะถอน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R672971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913def2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913d</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>826</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227:f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913d:ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>รายชื่อและสถานะถอน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D372971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913def2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913d</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>827</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227:f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913d:ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="