.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>25f1ab97-5552-4fbe-9ef1-e73d9c561bb8</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913d</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>831</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227:f5b845a5-7642-4848-be64-fdb07b25913d:ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน in order to change the flow of program execution within 4.2 ตรวจและบันทึกคะแนน to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>รายชื่อและสถานะถอน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>72971263-a604-4105-a156-a34385c34227</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>ef2f69e0-387e-4a7c-9107-ef304a699d51</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S1e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>832</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72:782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to unauthorized access to D2 รายวิชา. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the source process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเกณฑ์ผ่าน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S1</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>T18e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>833</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72:782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>The D2 รายวิชา Data Store Could Be Corrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering is the act of altering the bits. Tampering with a process involves changing bits in the running process. Similarly, Tampering with a data flow involves changing bits on the wire or between two running processes.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across คำขอเกณฑ์ผ่าน may be tampered with by an attacker. This may lead to corruption of D2 รายวิชา. Ensure the integrity of the data flow to the data store.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเกณฑ์ผ่าน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>T18</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R8e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>834</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72:782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Store Denies D2 รายวิชา Potentially Writing Data</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D2 รายวิชา claims that it did not write data received from an entity on the other side of the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเกณฑ์ผ่าน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R8</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>I6e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>835</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72:782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow Sniffing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Information Disclosure</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Information disclosure happens when the information can be read by an unauthorized party.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across คำขอเกณฑ์ผ่าน may be sniffed by an attacker. Depending on what type of data an attacker can read, it may be used to attack other parts of the system or simply be a disclosure of information leading to compliance violations. Consider encrypting the data flow.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเกณฑ์ผ่าน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>I6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D4e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>836</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72:782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow คำขอเกณฑ์ผ่าน Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเกณฑ์ผ่าน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D4</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D5e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>837</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:4f2d6bb1-0f38-4f0a-bfb3-5fe96f548a72:782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Store Inaccessible</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent prevents access to a data store on the other side of the trust boundary.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอเกณฑ์ผ่าน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S2782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>838</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c:34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by D2 รายวิชา. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R6782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>839</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c:34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D3782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>840</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c:34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา crashes, halts, stops or runs slowly; in all cases violating an availability metric.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D3</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D4782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9df