-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>844</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c:34fc6ce3-a086-4259-b310-5cda9dfa9c46:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา in order to change the flow of program execution within 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกณฑ์ผ่านของรายวิชา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>782935bb-a69c-4a0c-a166-daf122d94e1c</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S2e22e88b0-3b34-4992-a953-52751e8cfcdaea89b429-69b8-4c2f-bef2-8df03b1ee9c3b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>ea89b429-69b8-4c2f-bef2-8df03b1ee9c3</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>845</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e22e88b0-3b34-4992-a953-52751e8cfcda:ea89b429-69b8-4c2f-bef2-8df03b1ee9c3:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by D4 นักศึกษา. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e22e88b0-3b34-4992-a953-52751e8cfcda</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R6e22e88b0-3b34-4992-a953-52751e8cfcdaea89b429-69b8-4c2f-bef2-8df03b1ee9c3b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>ea89b429-69b8-4c2f-bef2-8df03b1ee9c3</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>846</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e22e88b0-3b34-4992-a953-52751e8cfcda:ea89b429-69b8-4c2f-bef2-8df03b1ee9c3:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอคะแนน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e22e88b0-3b34-4992-a953-52751e8cfcda</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D3e22e88b0-3b34-4992-a953-52751e8cfcdaea89b429-69b8-4c2f-bef2-8df03b1ee9c3b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>ea89b429-69b8-4c2f-bef2-8df03b1ee9c3</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>847</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e22e88b0-3b34-4992-a953-52751e8cfcda:ea89b429-69b8-4c2f-bef2-8df03b1ee9c3:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา crashes, halts, stops or runs slowly; in all cases violating an availability metric.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Ke