b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา May be Subject to Elevation of Privilege Using Remote Code Execution</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์ may be able to remotely execute code for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>กิจกรรมและน้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E730bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1835fc8de-3f0b-4ad1-98c1-5233fdcc14e6b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>835fc8de-3f0b-4ad1-98c1-5233fdcc14e6</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>916</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1:835fc8de-3f0b-4ad1-98c1-5233fdcc14e6:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา in order to change the flow of program execution within 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>กิจกรรมและน้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S1b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb2730bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>917</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to unauthorized access to D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the source process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอน้ำหนักกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S1</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>T18b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb2730bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>918</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>The D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์ Data Store Could Be Corrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering is the act of altering the bits. Tampering with a process involves changing bits in the running process. Similarly, Tampering with a data flow involves changing bits on the wire or between two running processes.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across คำขอน้ำหนักกิจกรรม may be tampered with by an attacker. This may lead to corruption of D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์. Ensure the integrity of the data flow to the data store.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอน้ำหนักกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>T18</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R8b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb2730bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>919</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Store Denies D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์ Potentially Writing Data</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์ claims that it did not write data received from an entity on the other side of the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอน้ำหนักกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R8</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>I6b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb2730bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>920</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow Sniffing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Information Disclosure</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Information disclosure happens when the information can be read by an unauthorized party.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across คำขอน้ำหนักกิจกรรม may be sniffed by an attacker. Depending on what type of data an attacker can read, it may be used to attack other parts of the system or simply be a disclosure of information leading to compliance violations. Consider encrypting the data flow.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอน้ำหนักกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>I6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D4b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb2730bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>921</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow คำขอน้ำหนักกิจกรรม Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอน้ำหนักกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D4</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D5b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb2730bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>922</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:3ff1e4b0-9989-48e0-b05a-3105728ddb27:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Store Inaccessible</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent prevents access to a data store on the other side of the trust boundary.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอน้ำหนักกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S1e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa852919693630bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>923</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to unauthorized access to D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the source process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอ CLO และกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S1</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>T18e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa852919693630bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>924</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>The D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์ Data Store Could Be Corrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering is the act of altering the bits. Tampering with a process involves changing bits in the running process. Similarly, Tampering with a data flow involves changing bits on the wire or between two running processes.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across คำขอ CLO และกิจกรรม may be tampered with by an attacker. This may lead to corruption of D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์. Ensure the integrity of the data flow to the data store.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอ CLO และกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>T18</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R8e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa852919693630bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>925</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Store Denies D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์ Potentially Writing Data</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์ claims that it did not write data received from an entity on the other side of the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอ CLO และกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R8</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>I6e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa852919693630bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>926</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow Sniffing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Information Disclosure</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Information disclosure happens when the information can be read by an unauthorized party.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across คำขอ CLO และกิจกรรม may be sniffed by an attacker. Depending on what type of data an attacker can read, it may be used to attack other parts of the system or simply be a disclosure of information leading to compliance violations. Consider encrypting the data flow.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอ CLO และกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>I6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D4e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa852919693630bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>927</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow คำขอ CLO และกิจกรรม Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอ CLO และกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D4</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D5e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa852919693630bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>928</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:94d7fec9-39cc-449c-ae55-fa8529196936:30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Store Inaccessible</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent prevents access to a data store on the other side of the trust boundary.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอ CLO และกิจกรรม</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S230bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac163c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6ae9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>929</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1:63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>CLO · กิจกรรม · น้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R630bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac163c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6ae9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>930</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1:63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>CLO · กิจกรรม · น้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D330bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac163c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6ae9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>931</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1:63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา crashes, halts, stops or runs slowly; in all cases violating an availability metric.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>CLO · กิจกรรม · น้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D3</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D430bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac163c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6ae9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>932</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1:63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow CLO · กิจกรรม · น้ำหนัก Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</