nt prevents access to a data store on the other side of the trust boundary.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>CLO · กิจกรรม · น้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E630bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac163c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6ae9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>934</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1:63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา May be Subject to Elevation of Privilege Using Remote Code Execution</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D3 CLO กิจกรรม และเกณฑ์ may be able to remotely execute code for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>CLO · กิจกรรม · น้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E730bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac163c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6ae9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>935</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1:63c276ec-cc37-445a-9323-507ad3da7a6a:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา in order to change the flow of program execution within 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>CLO · กิจกรรม · น้ำหนัก</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>30bd1f8e-e311-4fb8-987d-d47f5b757ac1</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S1b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8eafb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c997d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>936</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9:97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to unauthorized access to D6 เกรด. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the source process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่ตรึง</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S1</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>T18b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8eafb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c997d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>937</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9:97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>The D6 เกรด Data Store Could Be Corrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering is the act of altering the bits. Tampering with a process involves changing bits in the running process. Similarly, Tampering with a data flow involves changing bits on the wire or between two running processes.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่ตรึง may be tampered with by an attacker. This may lead to corruption of D6 เกรด. Ensure the integrity of the data flow to the data store.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่ตรึง</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>T18</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R8b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8eafb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c997d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>938</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9:97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Store Denies D6 เกรด Potentially Writing Data</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D6 เกรด claims that it did not write data received from an entity on the other side of the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่ตรึง</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R8</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>I6b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8eafb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c997d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>939</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9:97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow Sniffing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Information Disclosure</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Information disclosure happens when the information can be read by an unauthorized party.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่ตรึง may be sniffed by an attacker. Depending on what type of data an attacker can read, it may be used to attack other parts of the system or simply be a disclosure of information leading to compliance violations. Consider encrypting the data flow.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่ตรึง</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>I6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D4b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8eafb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c997d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>940</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:afb47175-5335-4191-b3d4-8995effcf0c9:97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่ตรึง Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่ตรึง</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D4</b:TypeId><b: