ing><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R697d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>943</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5:f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D397d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>944</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5:f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา crashes, halts, stops or runs slowly; in all cases violating an availability metric.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D3</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D497d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>945</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5:f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่มีอยู่ Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D4</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D597d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>946</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5:f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Store Inaccessible</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent prevents access to a data store on the other side of the trust boundary.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D5</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E697d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>947</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5:f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา May be Subject to Elevation of Privilege Using Remote Code Execution</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>D6 เกรด may be able to remotely execute code for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E797d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>948</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5:f29d034d-fd12-42fe-a6c9-d30a985f4465:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา in order to change the flow of program execution within 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · เกรดที่มีอยู่</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>97d608ab-dd06-4153-a21b-ba8bc7c66ba5</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S8e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be509ff1b4-5b73-4622-8379-91750be57a68bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>509ff1b4-5b73-4622-8379-91750be57a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>949</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:509ff1b4-5b73-4622-8379-91750be57a68:bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing of the ผู้สอน External Destination Entity</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ผู้สอน may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to data being sent to the attacker's target instead of ผู้สอน. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the external entity.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอดูผลและรายงาน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S8</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R7e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be509ff1b4-5b73-4622-8379-91750be57a68bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>509ff1b4-5b73-4622-8379-91750be57a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>950</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:509ff1b4-5b73-4622-8379-91750be57a68:bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>External Entity ผู้สอน Potentially Denies Receiving Data</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ผู้สอน claims that it did not receive data from a process on the other side of the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอดูผลและรายงาน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D4e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be509ff1b4-5b73-4622-8379-91750be57a68bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>509ff1b4-5b73-4622-8379-91750be57a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>951</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be:509ff1b4-5b73-4622-8379-91750be57a68:bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow คำขอดูผลและรายงาน Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>คำขอดูผลและรายงาน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D4</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S2bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>952</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by ผู้สอน. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>T1bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>953</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Lack of Input Validation for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering is the act of altering the bits. Tampering with a process involves changing bits in the running process. Similarly, Tampering with a data flow involves changing bits on the wire or between two running processes.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ may be tampered with by an attacker. This may lead to a denial of service attack against 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา or an elevation of privilege attack against 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา or an information disclosure by 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา. Failure to verify that input is as expected is a root cause of a very large number of exploitable issues. Consider all paths and the way they handle data. Verify that all input is verified for correctness using an approved list input validation approach.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>T1</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R6bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>954</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>I6bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>955</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow Sniffing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Information Disclosure</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Information disclosure happens when the information can be read by an unauthorized party.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ may be sniffed by an attacker. Depending on what type of data an attacker can read, it may be used to attack other parts of the system or simply be a disclosure of information leading to compliance violations. Consider encrypting the data flow.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>I6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D3bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>956</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา crashes, halts, stops or runs slowly; in all cases violating an availability metric.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D3</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D4bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>957</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D4</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E6bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>958</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา May be Subject to Elevation of Privilege Using Remote Code Execution</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ผู้สอน may be able to remotely execute code for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E7bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>959</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา in order to change the flow of program execution within 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>8404dcf5-bdd8-4902-abc2-3b6c967b0261bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>960</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:c68c2a41-dba2-46bb-8c21-bbac56799a68:e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Cross Site Request Forgery</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Cross-site request forgery (CSRF or XSRF) is a type of attack in which an attacker forces a user's browser to make a forged request to a vulnerable site by exploiting an existing trust relationship between the browser and the vulnerable web site.  In a simple scenario, a user is logged in to web site A using a cookie as a credential.  The other browses to web site B.  Web site B returns a page with a hidden form that posts to web site A.  Since the browser will carry the user's cookie to web site A, web site B now can take any action on web site A, for example, adding an admin to an account.  The attack can be used to exploit any requests that the browser automatically authenticates, e.g. by session cookie, integrated authentication, IP whitelisting, …  The attack can be carried out in many ways such as by luring the victim to a site under control of the attacker, getting the user to click a link in a phishing email, or hacking a reputable web site that the victim will visit. The issue can only be resolved on the server side by requiring that all authenticated state-changing requests include an additional piece of secret payload (canary or CSRF token) which is known only to the legitimate web site and the browser and which is protected in transit through SSL/TLS. See the Forgery Protection property on the flow stencil for a list of mitigations.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ผลการบรรลุ CLO · รายงาน Excel รายชื่อที่ต้องช่วยเหลือ</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>e9a7eaea-e508-43bb-8e9c-9fa8f7b7b5be</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>8404dcf5-bdd8-4902-abc2-3b6c967b0261</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S2bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd795ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6defb53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>961</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing the 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา Process</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to information disclosure by ผู้สอน. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the destination process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S2</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>T1bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd795ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6defb53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>962</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Lack of Input Validation for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Tampering is the act of altering the bits. Tampering with a process involves changing bits in the running process. Similarly, Tampering with a data flow involves changing bits on the wire or between two running processes.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล may be tampered with by an attacker. This may lead to a denial of service attack against 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา or an elevation of privilege attack against 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา or an information disclosure by 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา. Failure to verify that input is as expected is a root cause of a very large number of exploitable issues. Consider all paths and the way they handle data. Verify that all input is verified for correctness using an approved list input validation approach.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>T1</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R6bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd795ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6defb53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>963</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>I6bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd795ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6defb53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>964</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow Sniffing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Information Disclosure</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Information disclosure happens when the information can be read by an unauthorized party.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Data flowing across ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล may be sniffed by an attacker. Depending on what type of data an attacker can read, it may be used to attack other parts of the system or simply be a disclosure of information leading to compliance violations. Consider encrypting the data flow.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>I6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D3bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd795ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6defb53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>965</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา crashes, halts, stops or runs slowly; in all cases violating an availability metric.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D3</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D4bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd795ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6defb53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>966</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Data Flow ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล Is Potentially Interrupted</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D4</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E6bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd795ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6defb53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>967</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา May be Subject to Elevation of Privilege Using Remote Code Execution</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ผู้สอน may be able to remotely execute code for 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>E7bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd795ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6defb53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>968</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation by Changing the Execution Flow in 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An attacker may pass data into 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา in order to change the flow of program execution within 6.1 ประเมินผล CLO และติดตามนักศึกษา to the attacker's choosing.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>E7</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>8404dcf5-bdd8-4902-abc2-3b6c967b0261bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd795ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6defb53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>969</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79:5ae3594e-3e66-4369-bf89-a204a92f6def:b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Cross Site Request Forgery</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Elevation Of Privilege</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>A user subject gains increased capability or privilege by taking advantage of an implementation bug.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Cross-site request forgery (CSRF or XSRF) is a type of attack in which an attacker forces a user's browser to make a forged request to a vulnerable site by exploiting an existing trust relationship between the browser and the vulnerable web site.  In a simple scenario, a user is logged in to web site A using a cookie as a credential.  The other browses to web site B.  Web site B returns a page with a hidden form that posts to web site A.  Since the browser will carry the user's cookie to web site A, web site B now can take any action on web site A, for example, adding an admin to an account.  The attack can be used to exploit any requests that the browser automatically authenticates, e.g. by session cookie, integrated authentication, IP whitelisting, …  The attack can be carried out in many ways such as by luring the victim to a site under control of the attacker, getting the user to click a link in a phishing email, or hacking a reputable web site that the victim will visit. The issue can only be resolved on the server side by requiring that all authenticated state-changing requests include an additional piece of secret payload (canary or CSRF token) which is known only to the legitimate web site and the browser and which is protected in transit through SSL/TLS. See the Forgery Protection property on the flow stencil for a list of mitigations.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>ช่วงเกรด · คำสั่งตัดเกรด การปรับเกรดพร้อมเหตุผล</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>8404dcf5-bdd8-4902-abc2-3b6c967b0261</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>S8b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e9921dcbd-d7a9-4edf-ad0f-e79207db8322bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>9921dcbd-d7a9-4edf-ad0f-e79207db8322</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>970</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e:9921dcbd-d7a9-4edf-ad0f-e79207db8322:bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing of the ผู้สอน External Destination Entity</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Spoofing is when a process or entity is something other than its claimed identity. Examples include substituting a process, a file, website or a network address.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>ผู้สอน may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to data being sent to the attacker's target instead of ผู้สอน. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the external entity.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>เกรด · สถิติ · ไฟล์ผลการเรียน</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S8</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R7b53f4936-2fd9-4b5a-961d-015067f3fd8e9921dcbd-d7a9-4edf-ad0f-e79207db8322bf752304-447a-4c8a-8bd4-b2c80afdcd79</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>6494801e-5c12-44c5-9f44-0efa1e5bce93</b:DrawingSurf